al_provisional","interpretation_note":"按同段姓名及其所任、所述之事。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-050-xiezheng-wyd:p002:u0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"親從","person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"聽謝璟論兒者籠統言親從。"}],"source_position":{"revision_id":"cbr-ai-transcription-sha256:93d3d6c680a33b42bc9b39b58d3f320f659e9644cabc08c3601ab1bacf910fe8","source_layer":"received_biography","column_projection":[{"pdf_page":67,"half":"右","leaf":"十七下","column_from_right":10,"start":6,"end":21,"text":"徵幼聰慧璟異之常謂親從曰此兒非"},{"pdf_page":67,"half":"左","leaf":"十八上","column_from_right":1,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"常器所憂者壽若天假其年吾無恨矣既長美風采好"},{"pdf_page":67,"half":"左","leaf":"十八上","column_from_right":2,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"學善屬文初為安西安成王法曹遷尚書金部三公二"},{"pdf_page":67,"half":"左","leaf":"十八上","column_from_right":3,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"曹郎豫章王記室兼中書舍人遷除平北諮議參軍兼"},{"pdf_page":67,"half":"左","leaf":"十八上","column_from_right":4,"start":0,"end":7,"text":"鴻臚卿舍人如故"}]},"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-050-xiezheng-wyd","book_id":"b-liangshu-050","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liangshu-050-xiezheng-wyd1739"},{"id":"c-liangshu-050-xiezheng:p002","text":"徵幼聰慧，璟異之，常謂親從曰：「此兒非常器，所憂者壽；若天假其年，吾無恨矣。」旣長，美風采，好學善屬文。初爲安西安成王法曹，遷尚書金部三公二曹郎、豫章王記室，兼中書舍人。遷除平北諮議參軍，兼鴻臚卿，舍人如故。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-050-xiezheng:p002:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"徵","person_id":"684_eaa_511_AAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按同段姓名及其所任、所述之事。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-050-xiezheng:p002:m0005","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"璟","person_id":"684_eaa_511_AAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按同段姓名及其所任、所述之事。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-050-xiezheng:p002:u0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"親從","person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"聽謝璟論兒者籠統言親從。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":110,"last_line":110,"revision_id":1514482,"source_layer":"received_biography","raw_start":8976,"raw_end":9080,"raw_character_offsets":[8976,8977,8978,8979,8980,8981,8982,8983,8984,8985,8986,8987,8988,8989,8990,8991,8992,8993,8994,8995,8996,8997,8998,8999,9000,9001,9002,9003,9004,9005,9006,9007,9008,9009,9010,9011,9012,9013,9014,9015,9016,9017,9018,9019,9020,9021,9022,9023,9024,9025,9026,9027,9028,9029,9030,9031,9032,9033,9034,9035,9036,9037,9038,9039,9040,9041,9042,9043,9044,9045,9046,9047,9048,9049,9050,9051,9052,9053,9054,9055,9056,9057,9058,9059,9060,9061,9062,9063,9064,9065,9066,9067,9068,9069,9070,9071,9072,9073,9074,9075,9076,9077,9078,9079],"projection_sha256":"dfdd01b7cb55c442fcf04656f335b3beaea1323404bcd54fe6eedd04a79bdf0d"},"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-050-xiezheng","book_id":"b-liangshu-050","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liangshu-050-xiezheng-ws1514482"},{"id":"c-nanshi-059-wangsengru:p005","text":"時武帝制春景明志詩五百字，敕沈約以下辭人同作，帝以僧孺為工。曆少府卿，尚書吏部郎，參大選，請謁不行。出為仁威南康王長史、蘭陵太守，行府、州、國事。初，帝問僧孺妾媵之數，對曰：「臣室無傾視。」及在南徐州，友人以妾寓之，行還，妾遂懷孕。為王典簽湯道湣所糾，逮詣南司，坐免官，久之不調。友人廬江何炯猶為王府記室，僧孺乃與炯書以見其意。後為安成王參軍事，鎮右中記室參軍。","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-059-wangsengru:p005:m0014","surface":"沈約","start":14,"end":16,"person_id":"p8b_7w1_y3q","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-059-wangsengru:p005:m0025","surface":"僧孺","start":25,"end":27,"person_id":"59d_72d_924_AAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-059-wangsengru:p005:m0077","surface":"僧孺","start":77,"end":79,"person_id":"59d_72d_924_AAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-059-wangsengru:p005:m0120","surface":"湯道湣","start":120,"end":123,"person_id":"igj_rq2_zhf","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-059-wangsengru:p005:m0144","surface":"何炯","start":144,"end":146,"person_id":"d97_63f_52o","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本